WEBVTT

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:10.810
<i>And so, the Black Hero who relentlessly fought against the whole world...</i>

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.620
<i>...finally, truly broke down.</i>

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:32.490
<i>The Black Hero was sealed away far to the south</i>

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:35.560
<i>by the goddesses who protected the world.</i>

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:40.730
<i>But another monster lived in that region:</i>

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:46.580
<i>the Lonesome Devil, hideous and ever so lonely,</i>

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:48.520
<i>so lonely that he seemed to be dying.</i>

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:52.120
I want to get out of this place. I need power to get out.

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:55.360
Would you give me your body?

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.940
Would you let me eat half of your body?

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:04.370
Sure, go ahead. You're the first friend I've ever had, and all.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:09.340
For you, giving up my body is no big deal.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:19.960
<i>The devil called All Formulas was split</i>

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:26.970
<i>into the Solver of All Formulas and the Weaver of All Formulas.</i>

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:33.830
<i>And the hero devoured the Weaver of All Formulas on the spot.</i>

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:47.690
<i>The hero devastated the world repeatedly,</i>

00:01:47.690 --> 00:01:50.330
<i>until he finally reached the world's core.</i>

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:56.860
<i>But what he found there was the blackest despair, pain, loneliness, hell...</i>

00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:59.150
<i>And an endless darkness...</i>

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:08.540
Help me. Help me.

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:12.810
I want to destroy the entire world, but I'm going to die first.

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:17.400
Someone, please take this darkness... this pain, in my place.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:21.010
You can use the rest of my body, then.

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:22.990
You can put the darkness in here.

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:34.330
<i>The Lonesome Devil didn't regret it much at all.</i>

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:38.740
<i>Because he had made a friend, even if for but a moment.</i>

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:43.140
<i>Because he was able to live for this friend, even if for but a moment.</i>

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:52.440
<i>The Lonesome Devil is a fool.</i>

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:02.780
<i>A fool, to the very end.</i>

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:07.160
Sion's out pretty late.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:11.200
What's the big idea, calling us in and then going out, huh?

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:13.380
Claugh...

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:20.530
I know the reason we were called here today now.

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:25.810
A Distant Day's Promise

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:30.340
Are you... crying?

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.020
No.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:34.430
It sure looks that way.

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:37.350
It's just the rain.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:42.960
And? What are you going to do with me now?

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:51.470
I figured we'd end up like this one day.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:56.880
I've always been like that, thinking that things can't stay this nice.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:01.350
When I start thinking that I can't keep this up,

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:05.930
it always brought a sudden situation like this to mind.

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:09.090
So, Sion.

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:15.780
Do you... want to kill me?

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:22.200
I'm sorry, Ryner.

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:29.210
Ah, I see. If it was you doing it...

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:33.250
...maybe getting killed wouldn't be so bad.

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:40.760
But... Sorry, Sion. I can't let you kill me.

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:45.140
I mean, even if someone like me died, there'd still be a lonely fool around.

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:50.400
I've already made a promise. I've decided who will kill me.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:53.620
Ferris?

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:54.690
Yeah.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:58.650
I'm jealous. Well, I suppose it's fine.

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:01.570
After all, I broke my promise first.

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:05.200
I still consider you my best friend.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.230
Me, too.

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:09.080
Except that you're killing me?

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:09.860
Yeah.

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:11.960
You've already made your decision, huh?

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:13.120
Yeah.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.190
Then, I guess that's that.

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:16.670
Yeah, that's that.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:19.260
I shall end this, Ryner.

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:23.170
I hate to disappoint you, Sion, but you won't end a thing.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.780
You can't win against me.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:33.770
I can win. Get him!

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:44.510
What I seek is...

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:47.300
thunder! Izuchi!

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:03.550
What's all this, Sion?! Don't tell me you've...

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:07.930
Yes. I've brought everything to completion.

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:12.590
You're kidding! What the hell have you been doing in this country?!

00:06:12.590 --> 00:06:19.420
Nothing special. It's perfectly normal. I've merely chosen that which is necessary.

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:23.760
You carried out human experiments because they were necessary? Answer me, Sion!

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:27.360
What the hell are you doing?! What burden are you carrying on your shoulders?

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:29.330
Why do you take it all on yourself alone?!

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:31.700
Can I not help you?!

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.450
Are we just outsiders to you?!

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:36.900
Weren't we best friends?! Answer me, damn you!

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:38.420
Sion Astal!

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:43.260
What I seek is thunder! Izuchi!

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:47.410
Izuchi!

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:56.990
I... I won't give up, Sion!

00:06:56.990 --> 00:07:00.900
No matter how deeply you brood, how hopeless you grow...

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:05.510
No matter how far you sink into darkness, how hard it becomes to escape dark places...

00:07:05.510 --> 00:07:08.030
...I won't ever give up on you!

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:12.200
I will kill you.

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:14.430
I can't be killed by you.

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:15.860
I...

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:18.390
You can't kill your friend!

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:19.670
Come with me, Sion.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:21.340
Sion!

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:27.630
You will die here.

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:29.850
I won't die.

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:35.640
You're crying so strongly. I won't die until I save you.

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:38.830
Yes, I knew it...

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:43.470
I knew my decision was correct, Ryner.

00:07:43.470 --> 00:07:47.380
I will save you. No matter what happens to the world!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.580
What I seek is thunder!

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:58.290
Izuchi!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.120
Sion...!

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:35.080
There you are, my dear Lonesome Devil.

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:38.000
Thanks to you, I've escaped the sword.

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:39.470
Sion?!

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:44.540
You're...

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:47.160
Is it time? It's time.

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:50.450
I will consume you. It's time...

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:55.780
Time to wander in an eternal hell. I will send you there.

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:58.040
Send. Send...

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:02.010
Come, let us eat. The world is waiting.

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:04.880
Come, let us eat. The world is...

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.950
Stop where you are, Hero.

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:14.240
It is not yet that time, is it?

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:20.410
Who are you? The Alpha? No, you are not the Alpha.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:24.130
Then do not hinder me. I shall become true.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:27.300
You should stop. Now is not the time.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:30.460
You should know that as well,

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:33.330
Weaver of All Formulas.

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:36.520
I wouldn't have expected you to manage this much.

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:38.890
It seems that I made light of you a bit.

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:43.150
Now, stop him and release Ryner.

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:45.720
He wishes to eat.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:50.860
But now is not the time. He is crucial, and in a state like this...

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:53.570
The world won't change like this.

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:57.520
No one will be saved. Not him. Not you.

00:09:57.520 --> 00:10:01.390
Not even that girl, whom you cherish above all others.

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.790
Yes, I suppose you're right.

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:11.170
I'm glad that you have at least a shred of sanity remaining.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:15.100
Sanity? Do you have any room to speak of such things?

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:19.170
Rather, I would like to see any in you.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:25.660
But Sion is different. He would never lose his sanity.

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:32.250
That is why I chose him. Because he always chooses the correct path.

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:37.070
Sion will betray you, Ryner Lute.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:40.250
Hideous beast, lonely devil.

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:45.270
Until then, by all means, keep playing at your friendship.

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:50.750
Keep brandishing your silly justice and love, with no knowledge of his anguish.

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:55.370
Just enjoy your idyllic slumber as usual.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:58.690
Sion...

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:09.320
Hey. Hey, wake up.

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:13.420
Don't sit there half asleep. Wake up already. C'mon.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:18.360
Huh? Why am I...?

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:20.450
Still half asleep?

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:26.800
Come on, what's the big idea making me help out with work, then nodding off before me?

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:28.710
Ryner...?

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:36.300
Was I asleep? For how long?

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:37.430
Four hours.

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:38.460
No way.

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:39.550
For real.

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:42.390
Then... was it all a dream?

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:44.430
Huh? A dream?

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:47.560
Well... Actually, there was this really...

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:50.230
Hm? What was it again?

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.690
Hey, what's the deal?

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:54.620
I remembered it until just now.

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:58.500
I get the feeling it was a really bad dream.

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:02.030
Is that right? I guess it's a good thing I woke you up, then.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:05.040
Yeah, you saved me. Thanks.

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:07.530
Well, you were going on in your sleep like...

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:12.190
"Eheheheh, I'm surrounded by the lingerie of beautiful women! This is paradise!"

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:16.500
Frankly, I wasn't sure whether or not I should wake you up.

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:19.070
Uh-oh. My tastes have been revealed.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:23.850
Well, uh, when you just go along with it that readily, it's not that fun for me at all.

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:28.060
Then, why don't we get back to work?

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:32.560
It's all done. You should go to bed and get some real sleep.

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:38.840
You didn't do all of it by yourself?

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:39.660
Yeah.

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:41.080
You're kidding.

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:42.780
Why would you do it alone without waking me...

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:43.920
Aw, shut it.

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:47.120
I tried to wake you and you wouldn't wake up, so what could I do?

00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:50.290
Thanks.

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:51.530
Forget about it.

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:53.180
Thanks, Ryner.

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:56.670
Aw, just shut up! Go and get some sleep already!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:13:00.230
No. Since I slept for four hours, I'll resume work with you.

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:03.840
I haven't slept at all yet!

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:10.680
<i>Yes, that's it. This isn't right.</i>

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:17.130
<i>I know. It's time now. I have to advance forward.</i>

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:18.510
<i>That's why I...</i>

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:33.530
Kill. Kill him.

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:38.090
If he isn't killed now, Ryner will be doomed to never be able to die!

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:43.470
He'll end up wandering in Hell forever.

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:49.430
So, I'll save you... from the darkness, and...

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:54.950
Damn it.

00:13:56.310 --> 00:14:01.180
You win! I can't kill him!

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:05.910
No one... No one has won. You are me.

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:09.950
I suppose so. You are me.

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:11.260
Yes.

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:16.800
I'm... We're so terribly weak.

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:20.540
Yes. But we advance forward nonetheless.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.250
Betraying our friend?

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:28.670
Do we offer our friend as a sacrifice and plunge him into Hell,

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:30.080
then head forward?

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:31.660
That's right.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:32.890
It's unbearable.

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:33.820
Yes.

00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:35.810
It's unbearable for me.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.050
Yes.

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:38.310
And yet...

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:44.000
And yet I can't kill Ryner, or save him. I'm a weakling.

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:46.820
You did well.

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:49.250
Don't patronize me.

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:51.450
Stop blaming yourself.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.050
Your choice wasn't wrong...

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:54.690
What do you know?!

00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:57.370
What the hell do you know?!

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:00.910
I just want to disappear.

00:15:02.680 --> 00:15:03.630
Is that right?

00:15:05.950 --> 00:15:10.920
Consume me. I'll give you my mind.

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:15.110
Very well. You can relax.

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:18.100
There's no more need for you to agonize over anything.

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:21.810
I'll... I'll handle the rest.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:32.780
It's all right. I... I'll advance forward.

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:47.270
See you around.

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.950
Who's there?! Entry here is forbidden!

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:23.420
What the hell? He didn't kill me, after all that?

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:30.770
Hey! Hey, Mister Jailer! I've got a few questions for you!

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:32.930
Are you there? Hey!

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:37.960
Well, if he's not around, there's nothing for it.

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:44.150
I'll make you regret giving me that face and then not killing me!

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:46.360
I offer up this contract...

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:56.740
Ferris?!

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.750
What the hell are you doing?!

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:02.490
What? That's what I want to know...

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:04.220
Uh, Ferris?

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.790
I thought you were dead...

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:10.500
I thought you were dead!

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:14.810
I was told that you were really dead, and I...

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:20.020
I searched for you! I never believed it, even when Sion said it...

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:23.970
Never, never...

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:27.980
You saw Sion?

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:31.070
Something's not right about him.

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:37.080
He said he killed you, and smiled. Smiling, while crying his eyes out...

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:43.040
Even when I said it was a lie, that he could never kill Ryner...

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:46.260
...he just kept smiling...

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:50.340
He said never to come back, never to associate with him again...

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:54.010
He's marched the army into Imperial Nelpha.

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:57.820
He's spearheading the army with soldiers born of forbidden techniques,

00:17:57.820 --> 00:18:00.210
and slaughtering all the people of Nelpha.

00:18:00.790 --> 00:18:03.030
People all over this country are cheering it on.

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:07.410
Praising the Hero King, the Hero King who will rule the world...

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:13.320
They're wrong. All of them... Sion, everybody, the whole country...

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:19.540
It's all right. It's all right now, okay?

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:23.660
You don't have to worry about a thing.

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:40.070
Three cheers for the Hero King!

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.150
Don't let him escape!

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:42.940
After him!

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:45.190
We're getting out of this country!

00:18:45.190 --> 00:18:46.570
What do we do once we're out?

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:49.850
We'll look for some way to stop him.

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:54.070
We'll find out why this is happening and reveal the truth!

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:03.050
Over there!

00:19:03.050 --> 00:19:03.620
There he is!

00:19:04.110 --> 00:19:05.120
Wait!

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:09.080
Get out of here safely, Ryner!

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:12.040
Come on, Ryner.

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:12.590
Right!

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:25.570
<i>You know, Sion. I've always been grateful to you.</i>

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:30.430
<i>I was always dead. I was alive, but I was dead.</i>

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:35.640
<i>Since I was a monster, I couldn't be at anyone's side.</i>

00:19:35.640 --> 00:19:38.510
<i>I couldn't love anyone, either.</i>

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:40.360
<i>I thought there was no point in living.</i>

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:44.490
<i>I'd given up on everything, but...</i>

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:49.310
<i>You saved me. And from the bottom of my heart,</i>

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:52.590
<i>I've always been grateful for that.</i>

00:19:53.320 --> 00:19:55.760
<i>It may not have looked that way, though.</i>

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:13.450
What I seek is the burning field! Kurenai!

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.000
Pink hair?

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:22.810
It couldn't be...

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:24.410
Yes.

00:20:27.230 --> 00:20:30.920
<i>I want to return the favor.</i>

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:35.210
<i>So... I don't know what you're involved in,</i>

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:38.030
<i>but I'll go to you.</i>

00:20:39.140 --> 00:20:40.770
<i>To save you.</i>

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:50.470
All forces, advance!

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:58.820
<i>I don't know how much power it'll take to do that,</i>

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:02.330
<i>but I'll get a hold of all that it takes, and I'll go to you.</i>

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:05.840
<i>So, you just prepare yourself and wait until then.</i>

00:21:06.520 --> 00:21:10.730
<i>I'll make you regret not killing me then.</i>

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:16.650
<i>Despairing alone, bearing everything yourself, looking on the verge of tears...</i>

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:20.800
<i>I'll go to you, and I'll... I'll make you...</i>

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:25.640
<i>I'll make you say that you had the best friend ever.</i>

00:21:28.340 --> 00:21:31.230
Ryner, join me.

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:37.720
<i>So, I'm also going to head forward, Sion.</i>

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:40.550
<i>I'll save you, mark my words.</i>

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:44.150
<i>I won't ever give up on you!</i>

00:21:50.340 --> 00:21:51.790
Let's go, partner.

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:57.500
Right.
